    body: "Father and sons forced to manually clear rubble in Gaza\n\nNewsFeed\n\nFather and sons forced to manually clear rubble in Gaza\n\nForced to rely on basic tools, a father and his sons are clearing the rubble of their destroyed home in Gaza. Civil defence teams say Israel’s continued blocking of heavy machinery is slowing efforts to recover bodies still trapped beneath collapsed buildings.",
